    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38139" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Praetūtĭi</span></b> ,
			ōrum, m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a people of
			Picenum.</i>—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Praetūtĭus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>Prœtutian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					14, 6, 8, § 67</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pubes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					15, 571</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Praetūtĭānus</span></b> , a,
				um, adj., <i>Prœtutian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					22, 9</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">27, 43</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				3, 13, 18, § 110</span></i>; Inscr. Delfico dell' Inter.
			Pretuz. p. 118.</div>
